  "title": "Congressi%20Stefano Franscini Opens Call For Proposals For Conferences",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The Congressi Stefano Franscini, ETH Zurich's conference platform since 1989, gives the possibility to organise research conferences at Monte Verità, a hilltop over Ascona and Lake Maggiore. All researchers and university professors working in Switzerland are invited to submit their proposal for a meeting to be held in 2018; international collaborations are welcome.\n\nFurthermore, the CSF gives ETH Zurich researchers or professors the possibility to organise a Winter School for doctoral students at Monte Verità, a hilltop over Ascona and Lake Maggiore. The aim is to provide participants with in depth knowledge on a specific research topic and insight into its leading edge research."
    }
  ],
